00:07:12.018 --> 00:07:13.101
physical printing,

00:07:13.151 --> 00:07:16.005
such as a three-meter-high exhibition poster.

00:07:16.459 --> 00:07:17.819
The MBJZY

00:07:17.839 --> 00:07:20.537
Space Group logo, tagline,

00:07:20.561 --> 00:07:22.780
and orbital dome artwork command attention

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.788
at the top, while a clean six-card grid below

00:07:25.808 --> 00:07:27.594
organizes Our Uniforms,

00:07:27.774 --> 00:07:29.694
Our Rooms and Suites,

00:07:29.714 --> 00:07:31.227
Rocket Travel Offers,

00:07:31.251 --> 00:07:33.028
Food Offers, Our Amenities,

00:07:33.048 --> 00:07:34.535
and Tickets Offers,

00:07:34.584 --> 00:07:36.908
with concise gold-and-navy price badges that

00:07:36.928 --> 00:07:39.785
deliver instant clarity without cluttering

00:07:39.805 --> 00:07:40.680
the artwork.

00:07:41.122 --> 00:07:42.465
A bottom banner reading:

00:07:42.606 --> 00:07:44.549
Book your journey to the giant.

00:07:44.689 --> 00:07:46.345
Reservations now open.

00:07:46.525 --> 00:07:48.793
Departures starting 2095,

00:07:48.934 --> 00:07:51.687
closes the poster with a strong call to action

00:07:51.707 --> 00:07:53.051
and launch timeline.

00:07:53.905 --> 00:07:55.379
When presenting the project,

00:07:55.403 --> 00:07:57.857
you can flow seamlessly from the overarching

00:07:57.877 --> 00:08:00.200
vision and orbital architecture,

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:02.206
to the three accommodation tiers,

00:08:02.226 --> 00:08:05.614
travel logistics, Deck 05 buffet menu,

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:06.880
station amenities,

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.260
and large-format poster execution,

00:08:09.439 --> 00:08:11.724
demonstrating how every visual,

00:08:11.744 --> 00:08:15.708
price tag, and offer unites under MBJZY

00:08:15.728 --> 00:08:18.781
Space Group, to turn an ambitious space hotel

00:08:18.801 --> 00:08:20.900
near Jupiter into a vivid,

00:08:21.067 --> 00:08:24.286
complete, and unforgettable presentation.

00:08:30.025 --> 00:08:31.160
Mission briefing.

00:08:31.327 --> 00:08:33.152
Destination: Jupiter.

00:08:33.643 --> 00:08:35.954
Jupiter orbits the Sun about seven hundred

00:08:35.974 --> 00:08:38.646
and seventy-eight million kilometres away:

00:08:38.904 --> 00:08:41.771
five point two times farther than Earth.

00:08:41.938 --> 00:08:44.847
One Jupiter year lasts eleven point eight

00:08:44.867 --> 00:08:46.706
six Earth years.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.749
It is a true giant:

00:08:48.929 --> 00:08:51.226
three hundred and eighteen times the mass

00:08:51.246 --> 00:08:54.322
of Earth, and more than eleven times wider.

00:08:54.502 --> 00:08:57.672
Its gravity is two point five three times

00:08:57.692 --> 00:09:00.797
Earth's, and one day lasts just nine hours

00:09:00.817 --> 00:09:02.395
and fifty-five minutes.

00:09:02.912 --> 00:09:06.079
Deep inside, there is no simple rocky core.

00:09:06.232 --> 00:09:09.477
NASA's Juno spacecraft found a dilute core,

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:11.990
wrapped in liquid metallic hydrogen.

00:09:12.144 --> 00:09:15.340
It powers the strongest magnetic field of

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:19.009
any planet: about twenty thousand times Earth's.

00:09:19.513 --> 00:09:22.240
Its sky is about ninety percent hydrogen

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:23.955
and ten percent helium,

00:09:24.096 --> 00:09:25.821
painted in bright zones,

00:09:25.841 --> 00:09:28.343
dark belts and the Great Red Spot:

00:09:28.666 --> 00:09:31.013
a giant storm wider than our whole planet.

00:09:31.517 --> 00:09:33.993
And four great moons are waiting for you:

00:09:34.407 --> 00:09:38.255
volcanic Io, Europa with its hidden ocean,

00:09:38.275 --> 00:09:41.624
Ganymede, the largest moon in the Solar System,

00:09:41.816 --> 00:09:43.420
and cratered Callisto.

00:09:43.678 --> 00:09:46.181
Faint dusty rings complete the view.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.003
Behind the project:

00:09:49.312 --> 00:09:53.017
here is how Year 5A built the Space Tourism

00:09:53.037 --> 00:09:53.885
Agency.

00:09:54.377 --> 00:09:56.241
Step one: research.

00:09:56.408 --> 00:09:59.145
We studied the planets and chose Jupiter,

00:09:59.168 --> 00:10:00.056
the giant.

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.442
More than one thousand three hundred Earths

00:10:02.462 --> 00:10:03.923
could fit inside it.

00:10:04.378 --> 00:10:06.949
Its gravity is about two and a half times

00:10:06.969 --> 00:10:08.352
stronger than Earth's,

00:10:08.375 --> 00:10:10.725
so a forty-kilogram student would feel like

00:10:10.745 --> 00:10:12.323
one hundred kilograms.

00:10:12.777 --> 00:10:15.765
Jupiter also spins faster than any other

00:10:15.785 --> 00:10:16.530
planet.

00:10:16.709 --> 00:10:19.616
One day there lasts only about ten hours:

00:10:19.652 --> 00:10:21.725
that is five twelfths of an Earth day.

00:10:22.229 --> 00:10:24.263
Step two: the maths.

00:10:24.417 --> 00:10:27.131
Two Special Tickets cost five hundred thousand

00:10:27.151 --> 00:10:29.879
dollars, but the Companion Double costs four

00:10:29.899 --> 00:10:31.229
hundred and fifty thousand.

00:10:31.409 --> 00:10:32.909
You save one tenth,

00:10:33.063 --> 00:10:34.328
or zero point one.

00:10:34.508 --> 00:10:37.418
And fifteen percent off is three twentieths,

00:10:37.438 --> 00:10:39.471
or zero point one five.

00:10:39.976 --> 00:10:42.296
Step three: words that sell.

00:10:42.463 --> 00:10:44.405
We wrote a travel brochure,

00:10:44.429 --> 00:10:46.163
a poster and a website,

00:10:46.369 --> 00:10:48.442
using persuasive language:

00:10:48.491 --> 00:10:50.512
Book your journey to the giant!

00:10:50.679 --> 00:10:51.424
Best of all!

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:53.207
Reservations now open!

00:10:53.712 --> 00:10:55.303
We worked as one crew:

00:10:55.509 --> 00:10:58.193
Mohamed, Bolous, Justin,

00:10:58.217 --> 00:11:01.087
Zeyad and Yassin, sharing the research,

00:11:01.107 --> 00:11:03.662
the maths, the writing and the design.

00:11:04.166 --> 00:11:06.552
And this is our completed project model:

00:11:06.744 --> 00:11:08.000
the MBJZY

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.368
orbital dome resort,

00:11:09.388 --> 00:11:12.541
with its film, its poster and its website.

